  "body": "The \"allowed to show a popup\" algorithm can be more generally useful\nthan just in popup blocking. It should get a more general name so that\nit can be reused more broadly.\n\nThis commit also moves it into the \"Activation\" section, instead of the\n\"Browsing context names\" section, as the former makes a lot more sense.\n\n---\n\nThis is stage-setting for a follow-up PR that actually uses the concept, but I think it's a good change regardless, and I am pretty sure people have asked for it in the past. I can't find any open bugs though.\n",
